# Statue 170
# Simple statue with pedestal and torch eyes
# Origin is the player's position (~ ~ ~) when running the function.

fill ~0 ~0 ~0 ~4 ~0 ~4 polished_deepslate
fill ~1 ~1 ~1 ~3 ~2 ~3 deepslate_bricks
fill ~2 ~3 ~2 ~2 ~6 ~2 cobbled_deepslate
setblock ~1 ~4 ~2 cobbled_deepslate
setblock ~3 ~4 ~2 cobbled_deepslate
fill ~1 ~7 ~1 ~3 ~8 ~3 deepslate_bricks
setblock ~1 ~8 ~2 torch
setblock ~3 ~8 ~2 torch
say 🗿 Statue 170 complete!
